// The narrow list of operations a staff member may still perform while this
// device has no connection.
//
// Staff are read-only offline. That rule exists so two people cannot both
// change the same record while unable to see each other. These are the
// exceptions, and the reason each one is an exception is that refusing it
// would mean turning away a paying customer standing at the counter.
//
// Every entry here must also be marked OfflineAllowed in its operations file.
// A test enforces that, so this list cannot quietly contradict the other.
//
// SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(operation)

SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(counter_sale)
SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(take_payment)
SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(document_print)
SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(purchase_lookup)
SQF_STAFF_OFFLINE(file_search)
